# AMoCNA Project Overview

## What is AMoCNA

AMoCNA (Autonomic Management of Cloud-Native Applications) is a framework implementing an MRE-K (Monitor, Rule-Engine, Execute, Knowledge) autonomic control loop for managing Kubernetes-based cloud-native systems.

## Repository Structure

```
AMoCNA/
├── apps/                          # Application source code
│   ├── core/                      # MRE-K loop modules (main codebase)
│   │   ├── metis/                 # Monitor — watches K8s, writes topology to GraphDB
│   │   ├── palamedes/             # Rule-Enginw — detects anomalies, plans remediation
